---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="会員サイトテンプレート"
  description="Astro + Vue + Supabase + Cloudflare Workers で構築された会員サイトテンプレート"
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section
    class="from-brand-500 to-brand-700 relative bg-gradient-to-br text-white"
  >
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-24 sm:px-6 md:py-32 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center">
        <h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold md:text-6xl">
          会員サイトテンプレート
        </h1>
        <p class="text-brand-100 mx-auto mb-8 max-w-3xl text-xl md:text-2xl">
          Astro + Vue + Supabase + Cloudflare Workers<br />
          型安全で高速な会員サイトを素早く構築
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center gap-4 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href="/auth/signup"
            class="text-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-50 rounded-lg bg-white px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold shadow-lg transition"
          >
            今すぐ始める
          </a>
          <a
            href="/auth/signin"
            class="bg-brand-600 hover:bg-brand-800 rounded-lg border-2 border-white px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold text-white transition"
          >
            サインイン
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features Section -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-16 text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 md:text-4xl">
          主な機能
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
          モダンな技術スタックで構築された高品質なテンプレート
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
        <!-- Feature 1 -->
        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div
            class="bg-brand-100 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"
          >
            <svg
              class="text-brand-600 h-6 w-6"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">認証機能</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Supabase
            Authによるメール認証、パスワードリセット、ソーシャルログイン対応
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 2 -->
        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div
            class="bg-brand-100 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"
          >
            <svg
              class="text-brand-600 h-6 w-6"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M4 7v10c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4V7M4 7c0 2.21 3.582 4 8 4s8-1.79 8-4M4 7c0-2.21 3.582-4 8-4s8 1.79 8 4"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">データベース</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            PostgreSQL + RLSによる安全なデータアクセス、リアルタイム更新対応
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 3 -->
        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div
            class="bg-brand-100 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"
          >
            <svg
              class="text-brand-600 h-6 w-6"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">高速デプロイ</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Cloudflare Workersでエッジ配信、世界中どこでも高速アクセス
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 4 -->
        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div
            class="bg-brand-100 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"
          >
            <svg
              class="text-brand-600 h-6 w-6"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">ファイル管理</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            Supabase Storageでアバター画像などのファイルを安全に管理
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 5 -->
        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div
            class="bg-brand-100 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"
          >
            <svg
              class="text-brand-600 h-6 w-6"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">型安全</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            TypeScript完全対応、エディタ補完で開発効率アップ
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Feature 6 -->
        <div
          class="rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 transition hover:shadow-lg"
        >
          <div
            class="bg-brand-100 mb-4 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg"
          >
            <svg
              class="text-brand-600 h-6 w-6"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4"
              ></path>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="mb-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">管理者機能</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600">
            ユーザー管理、招待機能など管理者向け機能を標準搭載
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Tech Stack Section -->
  <section class="bg-gray-50 py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-16 text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 md:text-4xl">
          技術スタック
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">最新のモダンな技術で構築</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:grid-cols-4">
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 text-center">
          <div class="mb-3 text-4xl">🚀</div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Astro 6</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 text-center">
          <div class="mb-3 text-4xl">💚</div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Vue 3</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 text-center">
          <div class="mb-3 text-4xl">⚡</div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Supabase</h4>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 text-center">
          <div class="mb-3 text-4xl">☁️</div>
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">Cloudflare</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="bg-brand-600 py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 text-center sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="mb-6 text-3xl font-bold text-white md:text-4xl">
        今すぐ始めましょう
      </h2>
      <p class="text-brand-100 mb-8 text-xl">
        無料でアカウントを作成して、すべての機能を試すことができます
      </p>
      <a
        href="/auth/signup"
        class="text-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-50 inline-block rounded-lg bg-white px-8 py-4 text-lg font-semibold shadow-lg transition"
      >
        無料で始める
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
